§§ `s 825 to s 828 extent of obligation, protected information, periods`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` MEANS
    (NOT (`is weekend` d)) AND (NOT (elem d (LIST (Date 6 1 2026))))

