#ASSERT `s 827 the last day of a period of days counting only working days` (Date 1 1 2026) 3 `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS (Date 7 1 2026)
-- 827: after Fri 2 Jan: Mon 5, (Tue 6 skipped), Wed 7, Thu 8
#ASSERT `s 827 the last day of a period of days counting only working days` (Date 2 1 2026) 3 `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS (Date 8 1 2026)
-- 827: one working day after Saturday 3 Jan is Monday 5 Jan
#ASSERT `s 827 the last day of a period of days counting only working days` (Date 3 1 2026) 1 `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS (Date 5 1 2026)
-- 827: one working day after Monday 5 Jan skips the listed Tuesday 6 Jan
#ASSERT `s 827 the last day of a period of days counting only working days` (Date 5 1 2026) 1 `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS (Date 7 1 2026)
-- 827: a period of no days ends where it starts
#ASSERT `s 827 the last day of a period of days counting only working days` (Date 5 1 2026) 0 `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS (Date 5 1 2026)
-- 827: Fri 2, Mon 5, Wed 7: three; the weekend and the listed Tuesday are disregarded
#ASSERT `s 827 the number of working days after one date up to and including another` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 7 1 2026) `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS 3
-- 827: the same day: none
#ASSERT `s 827 the number of working days after one date up to and including another` (Date 7 1 2026) (Date 7 1 2026) `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS 0
-- 827: after Fri 2 Jan up to Mon 5 Jan: one
#ASSERT `s 827 the number of working days after one date up to and including another` (Date 2 1 2026) (Date 5 1 2026) `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS 1
-- 827: the listed Tuesday does not count
#ASSERT `s 827 the number of working days after one date up to and including another` (Date 5 1 2026) (Date 6 1 2026) `s 827 test: a day is a working day unless it is a weekend or 6 January 2026` EQUALS 0
